      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Came here to suggest this, my vrchat screenshots folder is an absolute mess of upside down and sideways screenshots.\nRather than using the absolute \"down\" direction of the world to orient them though, I think it should be based on the \"down\" direction relative to your head tracking rotation.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
