      "reactions": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I'd like to be able to rotate the photo to 90, 180, or 270 degrees depending on the camera tilt and save it.\nI think it should be based on the downward direction of the world, not the angle of rotation of the head. Just like when you use the iPhone camera with your head tilted, the direction of gravity is down.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
